<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Shadow Priest</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to drop powerful gear. In Phase 3, this includes the World Bosses Nalak the Storm Lord and Oondasta.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak-the-storm-lord">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak the Storm Lord</span></h3>Nalak is similar to the Sha of Anger in terms of the loot drop table. It drops ilvl 522 Tier 15 Legs, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95302/leggings-of-the-exorcist">
<img alt="Leggings of the Exorcist" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01pant.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Exorcist</span></a>, and Gloves, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95300/gloves-of-the-exorcist">
<img alt="Gloves of the Exorcist" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01glove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Exorcist</span></a>, and various ilvl 496 Tyranical Gladiator pieces.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_zandalaribabyraptorwhite.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta is the other world boss released in Phase 3 that includes a lot of powerful ilvl 522 pieces in its drop table. The following pieces are relevant for Priests.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95181/amulet-of-the-titanorex">
<img alt="Amulet of the Titanorex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_127.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of the Titanorex</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95177/choker-of-stygimolochy">
<img alt="Choker of Stygimolochy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_124.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Choker of Stygimolochy</span></a></div></li>
<li>
