<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleons-warband">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon's Warband</span></h3>Galleon's Warband drops some decent pieces such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90435/ring-of-wretched-flames">
<img alt="Ring of Wretched Flames" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Wretched Flames</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90430/stomphowl-pendant">
<img alt="Stomphowl Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stomphowl Pendant</span></a>. These are fairly rare, but can be nice items until you obtain your Celestial gear.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger drops 496-iLvl item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces.<br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90913/sandals-of-the-shadow">
<img alt="Sandals of the Shadow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Shadow</span></a>, a decent early pair of Boots.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Shadow Priests in Phase 3</span></h2>Phase 3 brings the introduction of the Shado-Pan Assault and the Kirin Tor Offensive /<wbr/> Sunreaver Onslaught factions. The Shado-Pan Assault faction is linked directly to the Throne of Thunder raid and has ways of obtaining reputation up to Friendly, albeit slowly, allowing you to obtain pieces of their gear early outside of the raid. The Kirin Tor Offensive and Sunreaver Onslaught factions provide some decent pieces that will be replaced by Celestial Dungeons.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
