<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="crafted-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_helmet_goggles_pandariatradeskill_d_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Crafted &amp; Profession Gear for Shadow Priest</span></h2>Crafted items are no longer restricted by your Profession choice, except for Engineering, so this allows us to equip Tailoring items without being Tailors, if we need to.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77533/lightweight-retinal-armor">
<img alt="Lightweight Retinal Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_goggles_pandariatradeskill_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweight Retinal Armor</span></a> is a strong early gearing option for Shadow Priests and are obtained through Engineering. They let you take advantage of Cogwheel Sockets to get increased stat bonuses, and as a 476 piece, it has a solid amount of Intellect on it.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82439/robes-of-creation">
<img alt="Robes of Creation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_panda_b_01_red.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Creation</span></a> is a nice chest piece that also has a solid amount of Spirit on it, allowing us to use it for Hit itemization.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82437/spelltwisters-grand-robe">
<img alt="Spelltwister's Grand Robe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_robe_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spelltwister's Grand Robe</span></a> is another chest option that sacrifices Spirit for Haste, which is solid if you don't need Spirit for your Hit itemization.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82438/spelltwisters-gloves">
<img alt="Spelltwister's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spelltwister's Gloves</span></a> is another solid crafting piece that allows us to get more Hit for our 15% Hit Rating. It is also a 476 piece, so it comes with increased Intellect over Heroic dungeon gear.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79335/inscribed-red-fan">
<img alt="Inscribed Red Fan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_pandariatradeskill_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Red Fan</span></a> is another solid piece from Inscription that will carry you until you can buy pieces from Celestial dungeons.</div></li></ul>The following crafted items are all workable up til you have access to better gear from Heroic Throne of Thunder and should be used if you either have an excess of materials or gold to spend at the Auction House.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94278/falling-blossom-cowl">
<img alt="Falling Blossom Cowl" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_cloth_raidmage_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Falling Blossom Cowl</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94280/falling-blossom-hood">
<img alt="Falling Blossom Hood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01helm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Falling Blossom Hood</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94279/falling-blossom-sandals">
<img alt="Falling Blossom Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01boot.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Falling Blossom Sandals</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94277/falling-blossom-treads">
<img alt="Falling Blossom Treads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_cloth_raidmage_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Falling Blossom Treads</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Pre-Raid Shadow Priest Trinkets</span></h2>
<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>Shadow Priest should typically use two passive trinkets, sometimes one on-use and one passive, but rarely ever two on-use ones. In the case of Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria, we will default to our two standard passive trinkets.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Active Trinkets</ins>
<br/>There are no active trinkets of note for Shadow Priest, as all of our strongest trinkets are passive trinkets.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95814/unerring-vision-of-lei-shen">
<img alt="Unerring Vision of Lei Shen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unerring Vision of Lei Shen</span></a> by far and leagues better than any other option at any item level. This trinket is a must obtain as it synergizes immensely with the Tier 15 set bonus, causing our Shadowy Apparitions to appear more often as they appear every time you critically strike with Shadow Word: Pain (and Vampiric Touch with 4-piece). It is important to note that this trinket also single-handedly changes your reforging priorities where Mastery becomes more valuable than Critical Strike.</div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95711/breath-of-the-hydra">
<img alt="Breath of the Hydra" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_mindflay.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breath of the Hydra</span></a> is one of two notable options that is better than the other trinket that comes from Celestials. It is meant for DoT based classes as it triggers off periodic effects and gives a nice Intellect gain fairly often.</div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95669/wushoolays-final-choice">
<img alt="Wushoolay's Final Choice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_chainlightning.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wushoolay's Final Choice</span></a> is the final option from Celestials and while it will have you change up your gear priorities due to the massive hit it comes with, it can perform better in certain gear combinations than Breath.</div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95772/cha-yes-essence-of-brilliance">
<img alt="Cha-Ye's Essence of Brilliance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_mindsooth.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cha-Ye's Essence of Brilliance</span></a> is another option that you can use if you can't manage to get your hands on the above two trinkets, but its value goes down when you obtain the Unerring Vision of Lei Shen, seeing as you will very often have 100% critical strike rating so the base Critical Strike from the trinket doesn't help you and the proc bonus is extremely similar to the Breath.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="hit-expertise">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_marksmanship.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reaching Hit Cap for Shadow Priests</span></h2>In Mists of Pandaria your Hit cap is 15% or 5100 Hit Rating. Your priority is to reach these with any combination of Hit, Expertise, and Spirit, given that we have <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=47573/spiritual-precision">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_divinespirit.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spiritual Precision</span></a>. Keep in mind that some abilities, such as the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_draenei_female.gif");'></span> Draenei racial Heroic Presence, will contribute to your overall Hit needed.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hit-rating">Hit Rating</h4>At 15% Hit, your spell hits will no longer be able to miss raid bosses.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="gemming">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_uncut_purple.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Gemming for Shadow Priests</span></h2>Shadow Priest has always been a class that feels better with gear. The more Haste you have, the more fun your character is to play. We generally want to aim for Haste and Intellect on our Gems. Whether you want to focus on pure Haste-oriented gems or Intellect-oriented gems, you should sim the difference in any given gear combination.<br/>
<br/>Gems are also a great place to grab any Hit and Spirit that we may be missing.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="q9">Meta Gem</span>: <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95347/sinister-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Sinister Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sinister Primal Diamond</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76885/burning-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Burning Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_metagem_cut.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burning Primal Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c6">Red Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76694/brilliant-primordial-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Primordial Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_red.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Primordial Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c4">Yellow Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76699/quick-suns-radiance">
<img alt="Quick Sun's Radiance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_yellow.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick Sun's Radiance</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c11">Orange Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76668/reckless-vermilion-onyx">
<img alt="Reckless Vermilion Onyx" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_orange.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Vermilion Onyx</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c9">Purple Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76686/purified-imperial-amethyst">
<img alt="Purified Imperial Amethyst" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_purple.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Imperial Amethyst</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c10">Green Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76651/energized-wild-jade">
<img alt="Energized Wild Jade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_green.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Energized Wild Jade</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c3">Engineering Gems</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77546/sparkling-tinkers-gear">
<img alt="Sparkling Tinker's Gear" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sparkling Tinker's Gear</span></a> &amp; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77542/quick-tinkers-gear">
<img alt="Quick Tinker's Gear" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick Tinker's Gear</span></a>  &amp; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77541/smooth-tinkers-gear">
